          "text": "Reported sleep and general wellbeing"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Feels somewhat washed out and attributes this to poor sleep rather than systemic illness; says nasal blockage prevents sleep."
