          "text": "Respiratory symptoms and sepsis-related symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Respiratory symptoms improving; cough minimal and non-productive. Denies shortness of breath at rest, pleuritic chest pain, dizziness, reduced urine output, and confusion. Afebrile by home readings."
      }
    },
